{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 25, :comments ["<b>There is none like him upon the dust</b> — And the meaning: for he has dominion in the sea, not on dry land." "<b>Upon earth there is not his like</b> — Mighty ones of the world are like him, in that he does not fear. And some say: it is deficient, for the word is עשהו (made him), in that he does not fear:"], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 41, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:05:40.742254334Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}